"固件 firmware 是一组 .nca 系统文件（字体 / 系统服务等）。同样从你本人的主机导出，选择其所在文件夹。" = "Firmware is a set of .nca system files for fonts and system services. Export it from a Switch you own and choose its folder.";
"为什么 Shiori 不提供这两样：它们是任天堂的版权文件，随 App 分发属于侵权。Shiori 只负责导入你自己合法获取的文件，绝不附带或代为下载。" = "Shiori cannot provide these copyrighted Nintendo files. It only imports files you obtained legally and never bundles or downloads them.";

